<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="512621132"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1672413670"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Breathe"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kenzie"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Breathe"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:24.227"><div begin="00:07.322" end="03:24.227"><p begin="00:07.322" end="00:09.618" itunes:key="L927">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（继续，继续，吸气……）</span></p><p begin="00:09.692" end="00:13.955" itunes:key="L928">Eyes on the prize, I know sometimes you might fall on your way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔着目标前行 我知道有时候你或许会跌倒在前行的路上</span></p><p begin="00:14.491" end="00:18.751" itunes:key="L929">Throw your hands up and get down when things don't fall into place<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当一切不那么顺利时 举起你的双手继续认真做事吧</span></p><p begin="00:19.271" end="00:23.555" itunes:key="L930">Mad at the world, yeah I've been there before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对这世界不满 我之前曾到过那里</span></p><p begin="00:24.057" end="00:28.277" itunes:key="L931">Lost and confused and thinking that you can't take any more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你迷失困惑 认为你自己无法再忍受下去</span></p><p begin="00:28.858" end="00:33.135" itunes:key="L932">No, no, no, no, worry 'bout nothing, oh, it's all gonna be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都无需担心 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="00:33.655" end="00:37.855" itunes:key="L933">Oh, oh, oh, oh, you're really something, oh, didn't you know that you could<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你还是很了不起的 你难道不知道你可以的吗</span></p><p begin="00:38.479" end="00:42.486" itunes:key="L934">No, no, no, no, worry 'bout nothing, oh, it's all gonna be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都无需担心 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="00:42.554" end="00:47.385" itunes:key="L935">Don't worry 'bout nothing, worry 'bout nothing, nothing, oh, it's all gonna be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都无需担心 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="00:47.749" end="00:52.135" itunes:key="L936">So breathe, like you know you should<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以呼吸吧 就像你知道</span></p><p begin="00:52.559" end="00:56.719" itunes:key="L937">Yeah, breathe till you've understood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你应该呼吸着 直到你早已理解</span></p><p begin="00:56.760" end="00:59.957" itunes:key="L938">Until you're feeling like yourself again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你找到自己的状态</span></p><p begin="01:00.107" end="01:02.264" itunes:key="L939">Feel the sunlight on your skin<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你感受到日光照耀在皮肤上</span></p><p begin="01:02.507" end="01:04.645" itunes:key="L940">Keep your heartbeat beating<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断保持心跳</span></p><p begin="01:04.909" end="01:07.181" itunes:key="L941">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="01:14.483" end="01:16.797" itunes:key="L942">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="01:16.919" end="01:18.719" itunes:key="L943">In, out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="01:19.285" end="01:21.589" itunes:key="L944">In, out out out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="01:21.655" end="01:23.332" itunes:key="L945">In, out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="01:24.033" end="01:26.654" itunes:key="L946">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="01:28.480" end="01:33.301" itunes:key="L947">Take a look around you here right now you remember this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 看一下周围 你记得这个时刻</span></p><p begin="01:33.559" end="01:37.993" itunes:key="L948">'Cause you only got the moment to own it while you're alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为只有当你在这世间 你才能享有这一时刻</span></p><p begin="01:38.491" end="01:42.682" itunes:key="L949">Taking it all in one blink at a time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在刹那就记住这一时刻吧</span></p><p begin="01:43.276" end="01:47.523" itunes:key="L950">Just let it be and you will see everything will align<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">顺其自然吧 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="01:48.070" end="01:52.293" itunes:key="L951">No, no, no, no, worry 'bout nothing, oh, it's all gonna be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都无需担心 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="01:52.869" end="01:57.079" itunes:key="L952">Oh, oh, oh, oh, you're really something, oh, didn't you know that you could<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你还是很了不起的 你难道不知道你可以的吗</span></p><p begin="01:57.687" end="02:01.619" itunes:key="L953">No, no, no, no, worry 'bout nothing, oh, it's all gonna be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都无需担心 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="02:01.748" end="02:06.799" itunes:key="L954">Don't worry 'bout nothing, worry 'bout nothing, nothing, oh, it's all gonna be good<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都无需担心 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="02:06.905" end="02:11.317" itunes:key="L955">So breathe, like you know you should<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以呼吸吧 就像你知道</span></p><p begin="02:11.744" end="02:15.851" itunes:key="L956">Yeah, breathe till you've understood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你早已理解</span></p><p begin="02:16.042" end="02:19.151" itunes:key="L957">Until you're feeling like yourself again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你找到自己的状态</span></p><p begin="02:19.264" end="02:21.333" itunes:key="L958">Feel the sunlight on your skin<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你感受到日光照耀在皮肤上</span></p><p begin="02:21.627" end="02:23.811" itunes:key="L959">Keep your heartbeat beating<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断保持心跳</span></p><p begin="02:24.085" end="02:26.472" itunes:key="L960">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="02:33.673" end="02:36.025" itunes:key="L961">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="02:36.073" end="02:37.918" itunes:key="L962">In, out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="02:38.465" end="02:40.745" itunes:key="L963">In, out out out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="02:40.848" end="02:42.475" itunes:key="L964">In, out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="02:43.213" end="02:45.398" itunes:key="L965">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="02:45.408" end="02:48.336" itunes:key="L966">It's a mirror to your heart and baby just live<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你内心的写照 宝贝 好好生活</span></p><p begin="02:50.101" end="02:53.449" itunes:key="L967">Let the moment take you and make you forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让这一时刻填满你 让你忘记</span></p><p begin="02:55.047" end="02:57.909" itunes:key="L968">Put the mirror to your heart and baby just live<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是你内心的写照 宝贝 好好生活</span></p><p begin="02:59.710" end="03:02.010" itunes:key="L969">Just breathe it in, yeah, breathe again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吸气就好 再次呼吸</span></p><p begin="03:02.196" end="03:04.788" itunes:key="L970">Just go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="03:07.538" end="03:09.594" itunes:key="L971">Oh, no, no, no, no, no<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要</span></p><p begin="03:09.952" end="03:12.154" itunes:key="L972">Breathe in, breathe in, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吸气</span></p><p begin="03:12.181" end="03:14.407" itunes:key="L973">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p><p begin="03:14.489" end="03:16.188" itunes:key="L974">In, out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="03:16.894" end="03:19.126" itunes:key="L975">In, out out out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="03:19.260" end="03:20.940" itunes:key="L976">In, out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一呼一吸</span></p><p begin="03:21.636" end="03:24.227" itunes:key="L977">Go on, go on, breathe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续吸气</span></p></div></body></tt>